lunduke-about (0.9-6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Name the X server from SO_PEERCRED on the live connection, including a
    root-owned server whose /proc fd directory is not readable. DISPLAY is
    parsed as [protocol/]host:display[.screen], including unix/:N, unix/host:N,
    and IPv6. A remote or TCP display uses the previous fallback instead of
    a false "Unknown GPU".
