lunduke-about (0.9-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Left click focuses the row under the pointer, and Menu, Shift+F10, and
    right-click all Force Close that same row. Tab moves to the next row
    even when the window is not the active toplevel. A key delivered to
    another row does not open its menu.
  * With no display PCI device and no DRM card, the GPU line names the X
    server that owns DISPLAY. An Xvfb on another display is not that server.
  * Rows that share a name keep the pid or window id in a column that does
    not ellipsize, and the tooltip includes it.
  * Protected rows and rows with no process do not offer Force Close. The
    menu item stays insensitive and the tooltip is the reason.
